    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="71">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 71</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif monnes eage him mon ófaslea oððe his hand oððe his fot, ðær gæð gelic bot to eallum: VI pæningas ⁊ VI scill ⁊ LX scill ⁊ ðriddan dæl pæninges.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If someone strikes a man’s eye from him, or his hand or his foot, an equal compensation applies to all: 6 pennies and 6 shillings and 60 shillings and a third of a penny.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If a man's eye is knocked out, or if his hand or foot is struck off, the same compensation shall follow them all—6 pennies, 66 shillings and the third part of a penny.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif monnes eage him mon ofaslea oððe his hond oþþe his fót, ðær geð gelic bot to eallum: VI peningas ⁊ VI scillingas ⁊ LX scll' ⁊ þriddan dæl peniges.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
